    "turn_text": "It's unbelievable. And if it wasn't such a serious charge, it would actually be laughable. But yeah, it's the insanity of a hyper-partisanship in Washington, D.C., to where Nancy Pelosi's House of Representatives has turned into a committee of personal destruction for political purposes. It's insane. The background of this is. Last week I'm driving to the airport after a week of being in DC when all of a sudden I found out through Uh, the media that the January 6th committee is coming after me and wants me to come and, and, uh, testify about tours of the Capitol that were reconnaissance tours. Well, first of all, it isn't, isn't it amazing that they never send me a letter, but they send it to the press. That's a, that telltale sign right there.",
